# ShadowBaritone module: command_goto

shadowbaritone.command.goto.status.going_to=Going to: %s
shadowbaritone.command.goto.short_desc=Go to a coordinate or block
shadowbaritone.command.goto.long_desc.1=The goto command makes Baritone move toward the specified goal or block.
shadowbaritone.command.goto.long_desc.2=Wherever coordinates are required, you can use ~ just like in vanilla Minecraft commands, or enter ordinary numbers directly.
shadowbaritone.command.goto.long_desc.usage=Usage:
shadowbaritone.command.goto.long_desc.example.block=> goto <block> - Go to a block in the world
shadowbaritone.command.goto.long_desc.example.y=> goto <y> - Go to the specified Y level
shadowbaritone.command.goto.long_desc.example.xz=> goto <x> <z> - Go to the specified X,Z coordinates
shadowbaritone.command.goto.long_desc.example.xyz=> goto <x> <y> <z> - Go to the specified X,Y,Z coordinates
